Automated Windows 11 Installation Toolkit
Download, customize, and deploy Windows 11 with a single exe.

---

Windows 11 Installer is an open-source toolkit designed to simplify Windows 11 deployment.

It automates downloading the official Windows 11 ISO, creating installation media, applying custom configurations, installing applications, drivers, activating and optional post-installation optimizations.


